<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fake Ninja - Get Key</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #0a0a0a;
            color: white;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .container {
            background: #121212;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 400px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 5px; }
        .blue { color: #00d4ff; }
        .btn-group { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .btn {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 15px;
            border: 2px solid;
            background: transparent;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .btn-3h { border-color: orange; color: orange; }
        .btn-6h { border-color: #00d4ff; color: #00d4ff; }
        .rules {
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #888;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>FAKE <span class="blue">NINJA</span></h1>
    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 0.7rem;">FREE KEY - 3H OR 6H SESSION</p>

    <div class="container">
        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #aaa;">CHOOSE YOUR SESSION DURATION</p>
        <div class="btn-group">
            <button class="btn btn-3h" onclick="alert('Chuyển hướng đến Linkvertise 3h...')">3 HOURS</button>
            <button class="btn btn-6h" onclick="alert('Chuyển hướng đến Linkvertise 6h...')">6 HOURS</button>
        </div>
        
        <div class="rules">
            <p>● Key is valid for 3 hours (1x task) or 6 hours (2x task).</p>
            <p>● 1 key = 1 device - cannot be used on another device.</p>
            <p>● You must complete the Linkvertise task to receive a key.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
